# This MVP does not require n8n environment-variable access.
#
# After importing the workflow, configure the bot token and administrator ID
# locally inside the "Bot Config" Code node. The committed workflow keeps only
# placeholders; never commit the real token.
#
# Also create an n8n Telegram API credential with the same bot token and assign
# it to the Telegram Send Message / Send Document nodes.
#
# Polling uses bt_bot_state.telegram_offset and does not require a public URL.
